<title>USA: Wayne County, Mich., Building Auth $45 mln priced.</title>
<headline>Wayne County, Mich., Building Auth $45 mln priced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>AG Edwards &amp; Sons said Thursday it tentatively priced $45 million of Wanye County Building Authority, Mich., building authority capital improvement bonds, Series 1996 A, with a top yield of 5.70 percent in 2016.</p>
<p>The bonds are MBIA insured.</p>
